{"id": "z1831", "pool": "easy-mathword", "n_q_chunks": 12, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Zachary did 1 5 push-ups. David did 39 more, so that's 15 plus 39, which is 54. John did 9 less than David, so 54 minus 9 is 45. To find how many more Zachary did than John, we subtract John' s total from Z achary's. So 15 minus 45 gives us negative 30. That means John actually did 30 more push-ups than Z achary.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
