{"id": "z2143", "pool": "know-mmlu", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 14, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The correct answer is D, Latin America. This region has a rich history of Spanish colon ial influence, which is evident in its architecture. Many cities feature historic buildings with Spanish-style design s. Additionally, the economies in many parts of Latin America have developed unevenly, leading to significant rural- to-urban migration as people seek better opportunities in cities. So while other regions might share some characteristics, these three factors are most commonly associated with Latin America.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
